Vin10 in10 0 DC -0.189735465784172
Vin11 in11 0 DC -0.581224898910796
* passive invert in11 -> in11n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv11ia in11 inv11m 10000
Rinv11ib in11n inv11m 10000.0020000002
Einv11amp in11n 0 0 inv11m 10000000
Vin12 in12 0 DC -0.111795543916722
* passive invert in12 -> in12n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv12ia in12 inv12m 10000
Rinv12ib in12n inv12m 10000.0020000002
Einv12amp in12n 0 0 inv12m 10000000
Vin13 in13 0 DC -0.823095550463708
* passive invert in13 -> in13n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv13ia in13 inv13m 10000
Rinv13ib in13n inv13m 10000.0020000002
Einv13amp in13n 0 0 inv13m 10000000
Vin14 in14 0 DC -0.012347095180792
Vin15 in15 0 DC 0.323244960028846
* passive invert in15 -> in15n: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinv15ia in15 inv15m 10000
Rinv15ib in15n inv15m 10000.0020000002
Einv15amp in15n 0 0 inv15m 10000000
Vin16 in16 0 DC 0.942023997376646
Vref vref 0 DC 1
* passive invert vref -> vrefn: R2/R1=1.0000002 closed-loop -1 at A=1e+07
Rinvrefia vref invrefm 10000
Rinvrefib vrefn invrefm 10000.0020000002
Einvrefamp vrefn 0 0 invrefm 10000000

